+    <h1 style="font-family:var(--head);font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,78px);line-height:1;margin:0">Vertical Shorts Editor</h1>
+    <div class="hero-copy"><p class="tagline">Make Shorts of your game in minutes.</p>
+    <p class="sub">A small Windows editor made for vertical game clips: drop your recordings in, add big readable text, punchy transitions and sounds, design your end card, and export a finished 1080x1920 Short with the posting texts already written. It runs on your own PC.</p></div>
+    <div class="cta">
+      <a class="btn btn-steam buy-button" href="https://ragerun.itch.io/vertical-shorts-editor" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy now: $12.99</a>
