+
+<section id="how"><div class="wrap">
+  <div class="center"><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h2 class="big">Record your game. Cut. Post.</h2><p class="lead">Built for posting a Short of your game every day, without fighting a big video editor.</p></div>
+  <div class="rows side">
+    <div class="row">
+      <div class="text"><h3>Cut on a real timeline</h3><p>Video, text, voice, sound and music rows. Drag clips in, trim, split, reorder, undo. Space plays, S splits, T adds text, and the mouse wheel zooms. Rest the mouse on a clip in the library to peek at it.</p></div>
+      <img class="loop" src="media/ss_01_editor.webp" alt="The editor: library, phone preview, inspector and timeline" width="1920" height="1080">
+    </div>
+    <div class="row">
+      <div class="text"><h3>Text that reads on a phone</h3><p>18 text looks (hits, calm captions, pills and the house title), 17 fonts included or your own, and your own colours, outlines, shadows and boxes. Every text pops, slams, types or counts in, and can wobble or pulse while it's on screen.</p></div>
+      <img class="loop" src="media/ss_02_text_looks.webp" alt="Customising a text's look and animation" width="1920" height="1080">
+    </div>
+    <div class="row">
+      <div class="text"><h3>Design your end card</h3><p>Pick a moving background, put in your logo or your game's name, type a line like "Out now", choose the colours and how it comes in. One click makes the video, and every Short ends with your call to action.</p></div>
+      <img class="loop" src="media/ss_03_end_card.webp" alt="The end card designer with a live preview" width="1920" height="1080">
+    </div>
+    <div class="row">
+      <div class="text"><h3>Export every version, then post</h3><p>One click renders each version you set up (for example "Out now" and "Wishlist") in the background. You get the title, description, captions and tags for YouTube Shorts, TikTok, Reels, X and Reddit, ready to copy.</p></div>
+      <img class="loop" src="media/ss_06_posting_texts.webp" alt="Posting texts for every platform" width="1920" height="1080">
+    </div>
+  </div>
+</div></section>
+
+<section id="features" class="band"><div class="wrap">
+  <div class="center"><span class="eyebrow">Features</span><h2 class="big">What's in the box</h2></div>
+  <ul class="feats">
+    <li>A timeline made for Shorts: clips, text, voice, SFX and music rows, keys, right-click menus, undo</li>
+    <li>18 text looks, 17 fonts included, your own fonts and colours, in / loop / out animations</li>
+    <li>Zoom punch, camera shake and darken on any text hit</li>
+    <li>30 transitions: punch hits plus smooth blends, slides, wipes and more</li>
+    <li>Framing for the phone: fill, fit or panel, zoom, pan and slow push-ins, colour per clip</li>
+    <li>Original punch, pop and whoosh sounds and two music beds included; sounds play on hits by themselves</li>
+    <li>Beat grid: snap cuts, text and sounds to your music</li>
+    <li>Record a voice-over from your microphone while the Short plays; music dips under your voice</li>
+    <li>End card designer, or use your own end card video</li>
+    <li>Several versions per export, export presets and a background export queue</li>
+    <li>Cover picture maker for the frame people see before they tap</li>
+    <li>Posting texts for every platform, written from your hook and link</li>
+    <li>Templates, and your own templates</li>
+    <li>Optional AI voice lines with your own ElevenLabs key</li>
+  </ul>
+</div></section>
+
