+<section id="faq" class="band"><div class="wrap">
+  <div class="center"><span class="eyebrow">Good to know</span><h2 class="big">Questions</h2></div>
+  <div class="faq">
+    <details><summary>Does it record my screen?</summary><p>No, it edits clips you've already recorded. Record with OBS, your engine's recorder or Windows Game Bar, then edit here. Using Unity? Our Shorts Maker for Unity records the Game view inside Unity.</p></details>
+    <details><summary>Does it upload my videos?</summary><p>No. Everything stays on your PC: no account, no tracking. The posting texts are ready to copy, and "Copy &amp; open" opens the upload page so you can drag the file in yourself.</p></details>
+    <details><summary>"Windows protected your PC"?</summary><p>The app is new and not code-signed yet, so SmartScreen may warn you the first time. Click <em>More info</em>, then <em>Run anyway</em>. You only do this once. Unsure? Email us before you run it.</p></details>
+    <details><summary>Can I use the videos commercially?</summary><p>Yes. The videos you make are yours. Use clips, music and fonts you have the rights to; the fonts and sounds that come with the app are free to use in your videos.</p></details>
+    <details><summary>How do I get it after buying?</summary><p>itch.io handles the payment and emails you a download link. It's also in your itch.io library, with every 1.x update.</p></details>
+    <details><summary>Refunds?</summary><p>Within 14 days. See the <a href="refunds/">refund policy</a>.</p></details>
