+<!doctype html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+<meta charset="utf-8">
+<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
+<title>Privacy policy – Vertical Shorts Editor | RageRun Games</title>
+<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
+<link rel="icon" href="../../favicon.ico" sizes="any">
+<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@500;600;700&family=Nunito:wght@500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
+<link rel="stylesheet" href="../../assets/site.css">
+<style>.theme-hub main { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px 70px; } .theme-hub main a { color: var(--accent); } .theme-hub h1 { font-family: var(--head); }</style>
+</head>
+<body class="theme-hub">
+<header class="bar"><div class="wrap"><a class="brand" href="../../index.html"><b>RR</b>RageRun Games</a>
+<nav><a href="../">Vertical Shorts Editor</a></nav></div></header>
+<main>
+<h1>Privacy policy</h1>
+<p><strong>Effective 22 November 2026</strong></p>
+<p>This policy explains what personal data is handled when you use <strong>RageRun Vertical Shorts Editor</strong> (the "Software"), visit <strong>ragerungames.com</strong> (the "Site") or contact us. The controller is <strong>Muhammad Khizar, trading as RageRun Games, Karachi, Pakistan</strong>. Contact: support@ragerungames.com.</p>
+<h2>1. The Software: we collect nothing</h2>
+<ul>
+<li>The Software runs on your own computer. The editor opens in its own window and talks only to a small local server on your computer (127.0.0.1), which isn't reachable from the internet.</li>
+<li>Your clips, sounds, projects and exports stay on your computer. <strong>We don't receive them.</strong></li>
+<li>The Software has <strong>no account, no analytics, no telemetry and no crash reporting</strong>. It doesn't send us any data.</li>
+<li><strong>ElevenLabs (optional):</strong> if you enter an ElevenLabs API key, the key is saved only on your computer (in `secrets.json` in the app folder). The lines you ask it to voice are sent from your computer straight to ElevenLabs. We never see them. ElevenLabs' own privacy policy applies to that data.</li>
+<li><strong>Copy &amp; open:</strong> this button copies text to your clipboard and opens a platform's upload page in your browser. Nothing is sent until you choose to post it there yourself.</li>
+</ul>
+<ul>
+<li>The Software has no update check. Apart from ElevenLabs (only if you add your own key) and the pages you choose to open, it makes no internet connections.</li>
+</ul>
+<h2>2. Buying</h2>
+<p>Purchases are handled by <strong>itch.io</strong>. itch.io collects your payment and email address and delivers the download. itch.io's privacy policy applies. We receive the purchase details that itch.io shares with sellers (such as your email address if you choose to share it, and the order amount and country). We use them only to provide the product, support and refunds, and to keep tax and accounting records.</p>
+<h2>3. The Site</h2>
+<ul>
+<li>The Site is hosted on <strong>GitHub Pages</strong>. GitHub may log technical data such as IP addresses to run and secure the service (see GitHub's privacy statement).</li>
+<li>The product page's buy button loads a script from <strong>itch.io</strong>, which may set cookies or receive your IP address when you open the purchase pop-up.</li>
+<li><strong>Visit counters:</strong> some pages count visits and button clicks with a simple counter service (abacus.jasoncameron.dev). Your browser sends it a request when the page loads or a button is clicked, so it receives your IP address and browser details like any website. We only see the totals. The Site uses no advertising trackers and sets no cookies of its own.</li>
+</ul>
+<h2>4. Support</h2>
+<p>If you email us or message us on Discord, we use your name, email address or Discord username and your message to help you. Discord's own privacy policy applies to Discord. We keep support emails for up to 24 months unless they're needed longer, for example for a refund or tax record.</p>
+<h2>5. Legal bases (for visitors in the EU/UK)</h2>
+<p>Contract (to deliver what you bought and support it), legitimate interests (to answer messages and keep the Site secure) and legal obligation (tax records).</p>
+<h2>6. Sharing</h2>
+<p>We don't sell personal data and don't share it except with the services named above, or when the law requires us to.</p>
+<h2>7. International transfers</h2>
+<p>We're based in Pakistan, and itch.io, GitHub and Discord operate in other countries, so data may be processed outside your country.</p>
+<h2>8. Your rights</h2>
+<p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct or delete your data, or to object to its use. Email us and we'll reply within 30 days. You can also complain to your local data-protection authority.</p>
+<h2>9. Children</h2>
+<p>The Software and Site aren't aimed at children under 13, and we don't knowingly collect their data.</p>
+<h2>10. Changes</h2>
+<p>We'll post any changes here with a new effective date.</p>
+<h2>Contact</h2>
+<p>support@ragerungames.com and <a href="https://discord.gg/kj8D8kwttZ">https://discord.gg/kj8D8kwttZ</a></p>
+<p><a href="../">&larr; Back to Vertical Shorts Editor</a></p>
+<h2>Support</h2>
+<p>support@ragerungames.com and <a href="https://discord.gg/kj8D8kwttZ">https://discord.gg/kj8D8kwttZ</a></p>
+</main>
+</body>
+</html>
